ds release! If you don't remember, it's February 2027.Late pledges are still active, so it's not too late!As for us, we are working on a pretty big update to the game. This update will be our last update to the Demo, ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-31T13:18:53Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055888148","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:57:40Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4683730-1837955055356743","game_id":"steam-4683730","kind":"update","title":"Huge Demo Update!","summary":"First of all, a huge THANK YOU to everybody that’s given us feedback and backed us on Kickstarter so far! Please help continue to spread the word! We have done a pretty big update to our Demo that contains a bunch of improvements that’s based on all the feedback we have received so far, and we think it’s made the game even better!Major UpdatesYour very own Circadian Army inside of the Hamlet, and they now attack enemies during combat!Each large building can now have a bonus that can be activated","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-10T12:41:41Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1837955055356743","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:57:40Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4683730-1836506165564750","game_id":"steam-4683730","kind":"announcement","title":"Kickstarter now live!","summary":"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/stellify/secret-of-circadia","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-01T08:44:16Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165564750","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:57:40Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4683730-183